        {
          "id": "67199a29-0a91-3cb8-9d4e-6d82b4aaa6e0",
          "content": {
            "id": "67199a29-0a91-3cb8-9d4e-6d82b4aaa6e0",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Retailer dependency on value is 'out of control': Fmr. Gap CEO",
            "description": "<p>One of the biggest retail holidays of the year \u2014 Black Friday \u2014 is here, and shoppers are especially hungry for deals this year after tariff-driven inflation has raised concerns about affordability in many industries.</p>\n<p>Alex Mill chairman Millard \"Mickey\" Drexler sits down with Yahoo Finance executive editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brian-sozzi/\">Brian Sozzi</a> to comment on the value craze as retailers had to adapt their pricing under this tariff regime.</p>\n<p>Drexler also worked as the former CEO of Gap (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GAP\">GAP</a>) and J. Crew and is the founder of Madewell and Old Navy.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "One of the biggest retail holidays of the year \u2014 Black Friday \u2014 is here, and shoppers are especially hungry for deals this year after tariff-driven inflation has raised concerns about affordability in many industries. Alex Mill chairman Millard \"Mickey\" Drexler sits down with Yahoo Finance executive editor Brian Sozzi to comment on the value craze as retailers had to adapt their pricing under this tariff regime. Drexler also worked as the former CEO of Gap (GAP) and J. Crew and is the founder of Madewell and Old Navy. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Opening Bid.",
